  "text": "GPA Calculator\n\nACADEMIC TRACKER\n\nChanaka Malawige\n\nmadhurangachanaka2@gmail.com\n\nMENU\n\nHome\nAnalytics\nSettings\nHelp\nFeedback\nLog out\nGrades\nA+\nA\nA-\nB+\nB\nB-\nC+\nC\nC-\nD\nF\nSemester Weights\nSemester 1\nSave Changes",
  "html": "<div class=\"md:ml-64 p-4 w-full\"><div class=\"p-4 w-full\"><h1 class=\"text-xl text-primary font-semibold\">Grades</h1><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-4 mt-4\"><div class=\"mb\"><label for=\"Aplus\" class=\"block font-medium mb-1\">A+</label><input id=\"Aplus\" class=\"w-full px-3 py-2 border border-gray-300 rounded-md focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500\" type=\"number\" value=\"4\" name=\"Aplus\"></div><div class=\"mb\"><label for=\"A\" class=\"block font-medium mb-1\">A</label><input id=\"A\" class=\"w-full px-3 py-2 border border-gray-300 rounded-md focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500\" type=\"number\" value=\"4\" name=\"A\"></div><div class=\"mb\"><label for=\"Aminus\" class=\"block font-medium mb-1\">A-</label><input id=\"Aminus\" class=\"w-full px-3 py-2 border border-gray-300 rounded-md focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500\" type=\"number\" value=\"3.7\" name=\"Aminus\"></div><div class=\"mb\"><label for=\"Bplus\" class=\"block font-medium mb-1\">B+</label><input id=\"Bplus\" class=\"w-full px-3 py-2 border border-gray-300 rounded-md focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500\" type=\"number\" value=\"3.3\" name=\"Bplus\"></div><div class=\"mb\"><label for=\"B\" class=\"block font-medium mb-1\">B</label><input id=\"B\" class=\"w-full px-3 py-2 border border-gray-300 rounded-md focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500\" type=\"number\" value=\"3\" name=\"B\"></div><div class=\"mb\"><label for=\"Bminus\" class=\"block font-medium mb-1\">B-</label><input id=\"Bminus\" class=\"w-full px-3 py-2 border border-gray-300 rounded-md focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500\" type=\"number\" value=\"2.7\" name=\"Bminus\"></div><div class=\"mb\"><label for=\"Cplus\" class=\"block font-medium mb-1\">C+</label><input id=\"Cplus\" class=\"w-full px-3 py-2 border border-gray-300 rounded-md focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500\" type=\"number\" value=\"2.3\" name=\"Cplus\"></div><div class=\"mb\"><label for=\"C\" class=\"block font-medium mb-1\">C</label><input id=\"C\" class=\"w-full px-3 py-2 border border-gray-300 rounded-md focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500\" type=\"number\" value=\"2\" name=\"C\"></div><div class=\"mb\"><label for=\"Cminus\" class=\"block font-medium mb-1\">C-</label><input id=\"Cminus\" class=\"w-full px-3 py-2 border border-gray-300 rounded-md focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500\" type=\"number\" value=\"1.7\" name=\"Cminus\"></div><div class=\"mb\"><label for=\"D\" class=\"block font-medium mb-1\">D</label><input id=\"D\" class=\"w-full px-3 py-2 border border-gray-300 rounded-md focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500\" type=\"number\" value=\"1\" name=\"D\"></div><div class=\"mb\"><label for=\"F\" class=\"block font-medium mb-1\">F</label><input id=\"F\" class=\"w-full px-3 py-2 border border-gray-300 rounded-md focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500\" type=\"number\" value=\"0\" name=\"F\"></div></div><h1 class=\"text-xl text-primary font-semibold mt-6\">Semester Weights</h1><div class=\"grid  grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4  gap-4 mt-4\"><div><div class=\"text-sm font-medium text-gray-600 mb-1\">Semester 1</div><div class=\"mb\"><label for=\"weight\" class=\"block font-medium mb-1\"></label><input id=\"weight\" class=\"w-full px-3 py-2 border border-gray-300 rounded-md focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500\" type=\"number\" value=\"1\" name=\"weight\"></div></div></div><button class=\"flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-center gap-2 my-2 px-4 py-2 rounded-md text-white font-medium transition\n        bg-primary hover:bg-secondary disabled:opacity-60 disabled:cursor-not-allowed \">Save Changes</button></div><!--$--><!--/$--></div>",
